DIRECTORY [file-spec]

Lists the files of a folder. With no file-spec, lists the current
folder. Wildcards: * stands for any characters, % for one.

Qualifiers:
  /SIZE         shows each file's size in bytes
  /DATE         shows each file's date
  /FULL         shows the size and the date
  /OUTPUT=file  writes the listing to a file instead of the screen

Examples:
  DIRECTORY
  DIRECTORY *.TXT /SIZE
  DIRECTORY [.LOGS] /FULL
